  "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.": { en: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", hi: "देखें कि पुन: डिज़ाइन किए गए परिवहन अनुभव में यह सेवा कैसे काम करेगी। बैकएंड एकीकरण अंततः इस वर्कफ़्लो को आधिकारिक सरकारी प्रणाली से जोड़ देगा।", bn: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", te: "పునఃరూపకల్పన చేయబడిన పరివాహన్ అనుభవంలో ఈ సేవ ఎలా పని చేస్తుందో చూడండి. బ్యాకెండ్ ఇంటిగ్రేషన్ చివరికి ఈ వర్క్‌ఫ్లోను అధికారిక ప్రభుత్వ వ్యవస్థకు కనెక్ట్ చేస్తుంది.", mr: "ही सेवा पुन्हा डिझाइन केलेल्या परिवर्तन अनुभवामध्ये कशी कार्य करेल ते पहा. बॅकएंड इंटिग्रेशन अखेरीस या वर्कफ्लोला अधिकृत सरकारी यंत्रणेशी जोडेल.", ta: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", ur: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", gu: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", kn: "ಮರುವಿನ್ಯಾಸಗೊಳಿಸಲಾದ ಪರಿವಾಹನ್ ಅನುಭವದಲ್ಲಿ ಈ ಸೇವೆಯು ಹೇಗೆ ಕಾರ್ಯನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುತ್ತದೆ ಎಂಬುದನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ. ಬ್ಯಾಕೆಂಡ್ ಏಕೀಕರಣವು ಅಂತಿಮವಾಗಿ ಈ ಕೆಲಸದ ಹರಿವನ್ನು ಅಧಿಕೃತ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆಗೆ ಸಂಪರ್ಕಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.", ml: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", or: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system.", pa: "See how this service would work in the redesigned Parivahan experience. Backend integration will eventually connect this workflow to the official government system." },
