  "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.": { en: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", hi: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", bn: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", te: "అధికారిక దరఖాస్తు ప్రక్రియను ప్రారంభించడానికి ముందు మీకు అవసరమైన అన్ని పత్రాలు స్కాన్ చేయబడి సిద్ధంగా ఉన్నాయని నిర్ధారించుకోండి.", mr: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", ta: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", ur: "اس بات کو یقینی بنائیں کہ آپ کے پاس تمام مطلوبہ دستاویزات اسکین شدہ ہیں اور سرکاری درخواست کا عمل شروع کرنے سے پہلے تیار ہیں۔", gu: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", kn: "ಅಧಿಕೃತ ಅಪ್ಲಿಕೇಶನ್ ಪ್ರಕ್ರಿಯೆಯನ್ನು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸುವ ಮೊದಲು ನೀವು ಅಗತ್ಯವಿರುವ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳನ್ನು ಸ್ಕ್ಯಾನ್ ಮಾಡಿದ್ದೀರಿ ಮತ್ತು ಸಿದ್ಧರಾಗಿರುವಿರಿ ಎಂದು ಖಚಿತಪಡಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.", ml: "ഔദ്യോഗിക അപേക്ഷാ പ്രക്രിയ ആരംഭിക്കുന്നതിന് മുമ്പ് ആവശ്യമായ എല്ലാ രേഖകളും സ്കാൻ ചെയ്ത് തയ്യാറായിട്ടുണ്ടെന്ന് ഉറപ്പാക്കുക.", or: "Ensure you have all the required documents scanned and ready before beginning the official application process.", pa: "ਅਧਿਕਾਰਤ ਅਰਜ਼ੀ ਪ੍ਰਕਿਰਿਆ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਕਰਨ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਯਕੀਨੀ ਬਣਾਓ ਕਿ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ ਸਾਰੇ ਲੋੜੀਂਦੇ ਦਸਤਾਵੇਜ਼ ਸਕੈਨ ਕੀਤੇ ਗਏ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਤਿਆਰ ਹਨ।" },
  "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.": { en: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", hi: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", bn: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", te: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", mr: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", ta: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", ur: "یہ سروس فی الحال تجربہ پیش نظارہ کے مرحلے میں ہے۔ دریافت کریں کہ ورک فلو کو کام کرنے کے لیے کس طرح ڈیزائن کیا گیا ہے۔", gu: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", kn: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", ml: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", or: "This service is currently in the Experience Preview phase. Explore how the workflow is designed to operate.", pa: "ਇਹ ਸੇਵਾ ਵਰਤਮਾਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਅਨੁਭਵ ਪ੍ਰੀਵਿਊ ਪੜਾਅ ਵਿੱਚ ਹੈ। ਪੜਚੋਲ ਕਰੋ ਕਿ ਵਰਕਫਲੋ ਨੂੰ ਕੰਮ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਤਿਆਰ ਕੀਤਾ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ।" },
